---
import Layout from '@layouts/Page.astro';
import LinkList from '@components/LinkList.astro';
import { academicsYears } from '@links/registry';
---
<Layout title="8th Grade">
  <LinkList slot="sidebar" items={academicsYears} orientation="vertical" />
<p>Eighth grade is my last year of middle school, and I'm writing this partway through the year.</p>

<p>History is United States History this year, picking up right where seventh-grade world history left off. We're starting with the early years: the colonies, the American Revolution, and how the Constitution was written. I'm really enjoying it. After a year of empires on the other side of the world, it's interesting to see how those same ideas from the Enlightenment shaped the founding of this country.</p>

<p>In math I'm taking Geometry, and my favorite part has been proofs. A proof starts from what you know and builds, one step at a time, to something you have to show is true. I like that every step has to have a reason behind it.</p>

<p>Music changed a lot this year. I'm in the full symphony orchestra, so the strings now play alongside the band's winds, brass, and percussion, with a new music director. Playing cello in a group that big sounds completely different from a string orchestra.</p>

<p>I'm in my third year of French, which covers all of high school French 2.</p>

</Layout>
